  captureNotes: "North = +Z; UV origin = SW. One-shot explicit CommandBuffer.DrawMesh,
    no camera render callbacks. Static batches use renderer.subMeshStartIndex + material
    slot, renderer.localToWorldMatrix and renderer.bounds; never clone the whole
    combined mesh. Native terrain heights/holes + eligible static visual meshes,
    no collider dependency. \u771F\u5B9E\u4E16\u754C\u9AD8\u7A0B\u4ECE\u4F4E\u5CB8\u6C99\u8272\u8FC7\u6E21\u5230\u4E2D\u6BB5\u7EFF\u8272\u3001\u9AD8\u5CA9\u7070\u8272\uFF1B\u4E0D\u63A8\u65AD\u690D\u88AB\u3001\u6C34\u6DF1\u3001\u5761\u9762\u9634\u5F71\u3001\u51C0\u7A7A\u6216\u53EF\u901A\u822A\u8DEF\u7EBF\u3002
    Excludes transparent/cutout foliage, water, dynamic bodies, text, particles,
    lines, and collision-only objects. Coverage is a data envelope, NOT a playable
    boundary. Initialized scenery plus selected static roots captured; verify newly
    added shop/shore roots are selected."
